    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno būlī ngabīji ntaale akasolagwa kūfuma mu banhū kūlwa nīmo go ng'wa Mulungu, gīkī īme ha ng'wanya gwabo, abize mfunya wa shakwinha na shitambo kūlwa nguno ya shibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei adūgije kwiyūmīlīja nabo abo batamanile, na a babo bajimīīlile, nguno nū wei alī na būgokolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno yene shing'wigelile nang'hwe kūfunya shitambo kūlwa shibi shakwe, gīt'ūmo akafunījaga kūlwa nguno ya banhū bangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na atīho ūyo akisolelaga ikūjo lyakwe wei ng'wenekīlī ūlū atitanilwe na Mulungu, ūmo akitanīlwa ū Alooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno yene nū Kilisito atigūngūhije wei ng'wenekīlī, kwitūūla kūbiza Ngabīji Ntaale; alīyo akatūūlwa nū yūyo akang'wīla gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būhūgūji kūlwa būhūbi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūlī nayo mingī ī ya kūmuwīla kūlwa nguno yakwe ū ng'wenūyo, gwike īkī mulī badīzu ū kwitegeleja, īlī shilambu ū kwīsomboola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū kūlenganīla nī likanza īlo lyabītile, a bing'we ni mulī balangi ī haha. Alīyo mutaalī dūhū mugongile munhū wa kūmulanga hangī ī mihayo ya kwandya, ū mu malange ga kwandya a ga mhayo gwa ng'wa Mulungu! Hū kūhaya mutaalī ng'wigeleelilwe mabeele, ītī shilīwa shitimbu yaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno būlī ng'wene ūyo akang'waga mabeele ataalī ng'weleele, ataalī ū kūgūmanīīla ū mhayo gwa būtūngīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī shilīwa ī shitimbu, ī shene shilī sha banhū bataale, abo bilanga kūfuma mu nzīla ya kūbona mingī; a masala gabo gūmana ū kwīkomanya ī yabūbi nī yawiza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
